<title>USA: JTS Corp Q3 loss widens after write-off.</title>
<headline>JTS Corp Q3 loss widens after write-off.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $1.20	    loss  $0.21</p>
<p> Net loss	  125,193	  loss  13,468</p>
<p> Net sales	 33,265		   4,062</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  104,088		  63,642</p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $1.55	    loss  $0.34</p>
<p> Net loss	  126,646	  loss  21,881</p>
<p> Net sales	 35,056		   11,824</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  81,599		   63,642</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: JTS Corp said the current quarter and nine month results include a $110 million charge for in-process research and development related to the merger with Atari Corp in July.</p>
</text>
